Given: 3, 11, 27, 59, ?

The logic followed here is: 

 [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/7bf4eb6c083318db0e9ef12a309ddddcbda94c9cc191cb3b1cc5c7b924776e33.png] 

Hence, **123 **is the correct answer.

 [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c76c13ba2d2ab46b47f8a931ae621dac081a0cb266b142dc23f58659fac4a466.png] __Alternate Method__

→ (3 × 2) + 5 = 6 + 5 = 11;

→ (11 × 2) + 5 = 22 + 5 = 27;

→ (27× 2) + 5 = 54 + 5 = 59;

**→ (59 × 2) + 5 = 118 + 5 = 123;**
